# Compressed indexes (*.json.gz) and manifest.json are committed (~4.5 MB total) so that
# CI and contributors can run lint without fetching from NCBI. Indexes are keyed by study
# release (phs000280.v8), so several releases of one study coexist here.
# Rebuild with: python hv-lint/update_data.py --build-only

# Backup / scratch files
*.bak

# Source XML files fetched from NCBI (variables.xml, data_dict.xml)
*/variables.xml
*/documents.xml
*/pheno_variable_summaries/

# There is no visit cache. Checks 5.5 and 5.7 read one and were removed; 5.3 takes its PHT
# set from the PHV index instead, which is a fact rather than a regex inference.

# HTTP response cache (SQLite)
.http-cache.sqlite*
